# An AdaRace road.  One setting a line, then the points it runs through, closed
# back to the first: x  z  height  half-width  banking (metres, degrees; banking
# is positive when the right side is lower).  See "Your own roads" in the README.
name Fjordringen
kind circuit
# A long straight on the shore of a fjord, a fast right up the hillside, a
# hairpin at the top, esses along the plateau and a plunge back down to the
# water.
# The fjord, beside the straight and below the plateau
water   -100.0    150.0   105.0
water    150.0    150.0   105.0
water    400.0    150.0   105.0
water    650.0    150.0   105.0
